1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 20=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:44,960
I'm willing to take Xiuwan's place

7
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,559
and marry into the Yuan family.

8
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:53,119
Was this your own idea,

9
00:01:53,439 --> 00:01:55,199
or did Jinqi put you up to it?

10
00:02:01,519 --> 00:02:03,080
I went to Jinqi and told him

11
00:02:03,640 --> 00:02:05,800
Xiuwan didn't want
to marry into the Marquis's family,

12
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,839
but I did.

13
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:13,000
The way you usually are,

14
00:02:13,159 --> 00:02:15,400
you've never been this assertive.

15
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,120
You're right, Grandfather.

16
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,600
I've always been timid,

17
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:25,239
afraid to take any chances.

18
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:28,000
But lately,

19
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:29,679
I keep thinking about

20
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,680
a maid who served Jinqi.

21
00:02:32,039 --> 00:02:33,400
Her name is Lanxiang.

22
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:36,680
She was merely a lowly servant,

23
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:39,239
yet she dared to fight
for what she wanted.

24
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:40,904
In the end, she got her wish,

25
00:02:40,936 --> 00:02:43,290
and all three members of her family
became free commoners.

26
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:44,639
No matter how you look at it,

27
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,680
I have more advantages than she did.

28
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,119
If she dared to fight
for what she wanted,

29
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,560
why shouldn't I?

30
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:53,128
I can't compare with Xiuwan.

31
00:02:53,130 --> 00:02:53,990
I could never hope for

32
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:55,950
a marriage as good
as this one with the Yuan family.

33
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:58,640
But now that I have the chance
to marry into such a prominent family,

34
00:02:58,650 --> 00:02:59,720
I want to fight for it too.

35
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:03,280
I want to marry into the Yuan family

36
00:03:03,639 --> 00:03:05,000
and become the Marchioness.

37
00:03:05,639 --> 00:03:07,799
I don't want to spend my life
afraid to take a chance.

38
00:03:08,104 --> 00:03:10,030
I want to live
a life of wealth and privilege.

39
00:03:10,039 --> 00:03:12,339
♪In spring, my heart
sets out filled with hope♪

40
00:03:12,340 --> 00:03:15,140
♪For all the tenderness in this world♪

41
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:18,259
♪My heart brimming with anticipation♪

42
00:03:18,260 --> 00:03:22,638
♪Like an orchid in a secluded valley,
growing toward the sun♪

43
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:24,720
The Yuan family
is of distinguished standing.

44
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:28,280
The first Marchioness
was a Commandery Princess.

45
00:03:28,639 --> 00:03:31,038
I had thought Xiuwan

46
00:03:31,039 --> 00:03:33,880
was forthright and confident
from a young age,

47
00:03:33,976 --> 00:03:36,808
so I wouldn't have to worry
about her being taken advantage of.

48
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:39,880
You've always been timid,

49
00:03:40,159 --> 00:03:43,320
so I feared you couldn't
manage the Marquis's household.

50
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:46,758
But after hearing what you've just said,

51
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:49,478
I see that you know what you want

52
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:51,199
and can adapt to circumstances.

53
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:53,799
You're more suitable than Xiuwan.

54
00:03:57,319 --> 00:03:58,239
However,

55
00:03:58,439 --> 00:04:01,680
we still need to ask
the Yuan family what they think.

56
00:04:03,639 --> 00:04:05,560
After Xiuru spoke to me,

57
00:04:05,719 --> 00:04:07,320
I apologized to Yuan

58
00:04:07,479 --> 00:04:09,000
and asked what he thought.

59
00:04:09,599 --> 00:04:11,999
He said he only wished to form

60
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,560
a marriage alliance with the Lin family

61
00:04:13,759 --> 00:04:16,280
and didn't care which branch
the young lady came from.

62
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:19,399
Then we'll do as you wish.

63
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:24,360
Jinqi.

64
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:29,279
Grandfather agreed.

65
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,320
From today onward,

66
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:39,800
Xiuwan is confined
to Huaqiong Courtyard.

67
00:04:40,319 --> 00:04:42,079
Without my permission,

68
00:04:42,399 --> 00:04:45,079
she is not to set foot outside her room.

69
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,839
It's all right.

70
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,759
Xiuwan, bear with it for now.

71
00:04:58,360 --> 00:04:59,759
Once Grandfather's anger subsides,

72
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,320
we'll think of a way.

73
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,360
Jinqi is right.

74
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:06,360
Once six months or a year has passed,

75
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:08,519
we can consider what to do next.

76
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:11,159
I'll do as you say.

77
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:15,159
I'll do as you say.

78
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:27,860
(Yongshun Bookshop)

79
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:30,878
Of the houses we saw before,

80
00:05:30,879 --> 00:05:32,758
some were too expensive for you,

81
00:05:32,759 --> 00:05:34,679
some were too old for you,

82
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:36,679
and some had neighbors you didn't like.

83
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,040
They were all men.

84
00:05:38,360 --> 00:05:41,039
It's mainly because our family is small.

85
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,919
We have only one daughter

86
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,880
and no relatives nearby to help us.

87
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:45,958
If we happen to get

88
00:05:45,959 --> 00:05:47,639
a difficult neighbor,

89
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:49,000
we may not be able to handle it.

90
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,638
Your daughter is a fine young lady.

91
00:05:51,639 --> 00:05:53,440
You're right to be cautious.

92
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,670
I guarantee you'll be pleased

93
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:56,000
with the house we're seeing today.

94
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,040
Here we are.

95
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,360
Come in.

96
00:06:07,639 --> 00:06:09,199
Please, come in.

97
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,839
Go ahead and have a look around.

98
00:06:13,839 --> 00:06:16,560
This place is close
to the Central City Patrol Office.

99
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,740
At the slightest disturbance,

100
00:06:17,816 --> 00:06:19,470
the patrolmen
will come by to investigate.

101
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:22,320
You won't have
to worry about safety at all.

102
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,518
Most of the neighbors
are scholarly families.

103
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,688
Even if you don't get along,

104
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:27,110
you can simply keep your distance.

105
00:06:27,120 --> 00:06:28,959
Surely it wouldn't lead to any trouble.

106
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,560
The rent on this house
can't be cheap, can it?

107
00:06:33,439 --> 00:06:35,199
As for the annual rent,

108
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:37,480
it's this much.

109
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,839
Fifty taels?

110
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:41,958
Five hundred?

111
00:06:41,959 --> 00:06:43,040
Five taels.

112
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,880
Five taels?

113
00:06:46,079 --> 00:06:47,199
Five taels?

114
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:56,240
This house is in a good location
and in excellent condition.

115
00:06:56,270 --> 00:06:58,616
How could the annual rent
possibly be only five taels?

116
00:06:58,792 --> 00:07:01,640
The owner used to be a ceremonial usher
at the Court of State Ceremonies.

117
00:07:01,688 --> 00:07:04,540
After retiring and returning to
his hometown, he left the house vacant.

118
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,878
He isn't looking to charge much rent.

119
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:08,838
He just wants someone
to look after the house

120
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:10,399
and keep it from falling into disrepair.

121
00:07:12,839 --> 00:07:15,239
The annual rent
really is only five taels?

122
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,759
It really is.

123
00:07:17,759 --> 00:07:18,680
Look.

124
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,839
I even brought the lease with me.

125
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,758
Once you sign it,

126
00:07:22,759 --> 00:07:25,320
you can move in immediately.

127
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:28,679
Then let's...

128
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:30,240
Let's hurry and sign it.

129
00:07:33,100 --> 00:07:35,380
(House Lease)

130
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,959
Father.

131
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,240
Let's keep looking.

132
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,318
Yes.

133
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:48,359
Let's keep looking.

134
00:07:48,360 --> 00:07:49,638
Keep looking.

135
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:50,639
Let's keep looking.

136
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:52,599
Such a fine house

137
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,878
at such a low price.

138
00:07:53,879 --> 00:07:56,279
What more is there to look for?

139
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,800
Let's keep looking.

140
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:02,518
What exactly are you unhappy with?

141
00:08:02,519 --> 00:08:04,278
With a house like this at this price,

142
00:08:04,279 --> 00:08:05,359
it's an incredible bargain.

143
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:07,320
Why would you turn it down?

144
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:09,078
If it's such an incredible bargain,

145
00:08:09,079 --> 00:08:11,000
why don't you take it, Broker Liu?

146
00:08:12,430 --> 00:08:13,464
A house this good

147
00:08:13,496 --> 00:08:15,750
would normally rent for
at least thirty taels a year.

148
00:08:15,750 --> 00:08:17,000
But now you're asking only five.

149
00:08:17,010 --> 00:08:19,608
When something seems too good
to be true, something must be wrong.

150
00:08:19,610 --> 00:08:20,640
Such an incredible bargain

151
00:08:20,650 --> 00:08:21,880
is more than we dare accept.

152
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,360
Exactly.

153
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:24,679
We won't

154
00:08:24,680 --> 00:08:26,719
risk a huge loss just to save a little.

155
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:28,479
If you ask me,

156
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,078
this...

157
00:08:29,079 --> 00:08:30,480
this house

158
00:08:31,079 --> 00:08:33,518
either someone died here
and it's an ill-fated house,

159
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,758
or the owner

160
00:08:34,759 --> 00:08:36,359
must be mixed up in some trouble.

161
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,798
Do you take us for fools?

162
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,199
- Let's go.
- Wait.

163
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:43,959
We can still discuss it.

164
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,599
Let's talk it over.

165
00:08:57,759 --> 00:09:00,599
How am I supposed to answer to Jiugao?

166
00:09:15,799 --> 00:09:16,760
Young Master.

167
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:19,719
I failed to settle
the matter for Lanxiang.

168
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:22,760
Not only did I fail
to rent out the house,

169
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,800
but I also scared them away.

170
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:28,560
Did you find some fierce-looking broker?

171
00:09:29,039 --> 00:09:30,359
I wouldn't dare.

172
00:09:30,632 --> 00:09:31,790
You specifically told me

173
00:09:31,799 --> 00:09:33,119
to find someone friendly.

174
00:09:33,240 --> 00:09:35,999
Broker Liu is round and jolly,

175
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,560
always smiling.

176
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,719
He's warm and friendly.

177
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:42,719
But...

178
00:09:44,279 --> 00:09:45,959
Far too warm and friendly.

179
00:09:48,399 --> 00:09:50,320
The annual rent was only...

180
00:09:53,559 --> 00:09:54,800
Five taels of silver?

181
00:10:00,759 --> 00:10:02,359
Five taels of silver...

182
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:12,800
How gullible would Lanxiang have to be

183
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:15,160
to fall for a trick like that?

184
00:10:16,799 --> 00:10:18,079
You're right, Young Master.

185
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,010
Lanxiang is anything but gullible.

186
00:10:20,020 --> 00:10:21,450
She grabbed Uncle Xu and the others

187
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:22,879
and ran off without looking back.

188
00:10:39,399 --> 00:10:42,079
We need to find a decent house,

189
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:44,640
but one that's not
quite as good as today's,

190
00:10:45,919 --> 00:10:47,640
so she won't get suspicious.

191
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:49,398
Finding a house better

192
00:10:49,399 --> 00:10:50,758
than the one today would be easy.

193
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:52,680
Finding a worse one won't be.

194
00:10:57,159 --> 00:10:58,479
"If you know it won't be easy,

195
00:10:58,559 --> 00:10:59,760
then get going."

196
00:11:00,759 --> 00:11:01,798
I'll go right away.

197
00:11:01,799 --> 00:11:02,719
Right away.

198
00:11:09,080 --> 00:11:10,879
She's far too shrewd

199
00:11:11,279 --> 00:11:12,879
to be easily fooled.

200
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:16,680
She's bound to be
quite a handful in the future.

201
00:11:22,399 --> 00:11:23,518
Here, sir. Have some tea.

202
00:11:23,519 --> 00:11:25,678
This job doesn't look suitable.

203
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:26,199
Forget it.

204
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,440
Let's look somewhere else.

205
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:32,678
Father.

206
00:11:32,679 --> 00:11:33,560
Mother.

207
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:34,959
Here's a job posting.

208
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,878
(Job Posting)

209
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:38,000
I know about this one.

210
00:11:38,010 --> 00:11:39,839
The notice has been
up for over six months,

211
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,719
and they haven't hired a single person.

212
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:44,638
I heard the owner of this shop

213
00:11:44,639 --> 00:11:46,560
has a very peculiar temper.

214
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,999
He even judges applicants
by their looks.

215
00:11:49,159 --> 00:11:50,878
If he doesn't like the look of someone,

216
00:11:50,879 --> 00:11:52,560
he throws them right out.

217
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:54,918
And there's this.

218
00:11:54,919 --> 00:11:55,999
Look.

219
00:11:56,240 --> 00:11:57,920
Wages negotiable.

220
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:01,319
People who can read cursive script

221
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:04,400
go in eagerly to discuss
the wages with him.

222
00:12:04,480 --> 00:12:06,199
Guess what he tells them.

223
00:12:06,600 --> 00:12:08,119
Not a penny.

224
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:11,680
He says they'll split the profits evenly
once the shop makes money.

225
00:12:11,759 --> 00:12:14,239
Isn't that just getting people
to work for free?

226
00:12:16,559 --> 00:12:17,560
Father.

227
00:12:18,039 --> 00:12:19,199
If the shop makes no money,

228
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,450
then they'd be working for free.

229
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:21,758
But if the shop makes money,

230
00:12:21,759 --> 00:12:23,640
then it wouldn't be for nothing.

231
00:12:23,799 --> 00:12:24,999
If the shop

232
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,479
can make two taels a month,

233
00:12:26,480 --> 00:12:27,918
and I split it evenly with the owner,

234
00:12:27,919 --> 00:12:29,400
I'd get one tael.

235
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:30,439
There.

236
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,800
Lodging is included.

237
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:35,079
(Lodging Included)
If you work it out, the pay isn't low.

238
00:12:36,639 --> 00:12:38,079
Silly girl.

239
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:40,518
Money isn't that easy to make.

240
00:12:40,519 --> 00:12:42,710
If it really were that easy,
why did all the assistants

241
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,518
and shopkeepers
who worked here before leave?

242
00:12:44,519 --> 00:12:45,680
They all quit.

243
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:48,359
Let's go.

244
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:50,599
We'll find another broker
and look at more houses.

245
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:53,160
Father.

246
00:12:53,879 --> 00:12:55,599
What do you think of this handwriting?

247
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:01,079
I didn't see much cursive script
at the shop before,

248
00:13:01,080 --> 00:13:02,479
so I can't really tell.

249
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,440
But

250
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:07,040
the handwriting

251
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:09,119
seems quite good.

252
00:13:09,519 --> 00:13:11,680
Let's go meet the person who wrote it.

253
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:12,918
All right.

254
00:13:12,919 --> 00:13:13,798
Let's meet him.

255
00:13:13,799 --> 00:13:14,398
Come on.

256
00:13:14,399 --> 00:13:15,400
Come on, Mother.

257
00:13:16,039 --> 00:13:17,160
You two...

258
00:13:31,559 --> 00:13:32,719
Father.

259
00:13:39,399 --> 00:13:40,599
Is anyone here?

260
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:45,079
We're coming in.

261
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,599
Is that all right?

262
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,440
The door isn't locked.

263
00:13:49,840 --> 00:13:51,359
We're coming in.

264
00:13:53,440 --> 00:13:54,599
Is anyone here?

265
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:58,959
Father.

266
00:14:07,759 --> 00:14:08,800
Is anyone...

267
00:14:10,159 --> 00:14:11,440
You are...

268
00:14:12,180 --> 00:14:13,558
(Tu Wu, longtime servant
of the Lu family)

269
00:14:13,559 --> 00:14:15,199
We saw

270
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:18,199
the job notice outside
the painting and calligraphy shop.

271
00:14:20,639 --> 00:14:21,760
Come in.

272
00:14:36,519 --> 00:14:37,640
Seventh Master.

273
00:14:39,279 --> 00:14:40,400
Seventh Master.

274
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:44,758
(Lu Xie)
Seventh Master.

275
00:14:44,759 --> 00:14:46,599
(Courtesy name Hezhi, art name Zongbai)
Someone's here looking for work.

276
00:14:46,900 --> 00:14:51,140
(Han Liang, courtesy name Yizhen)

277
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,359
Mister Lu.

278
00:14:59,672 --> 00:15:01,680
The owner of the painting
and calligraphy shop.

279
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,440
Mister Lu.

280
00:15:07,039 --> 00:15:08,520
Greetings, Mister Lu.

281
00:15:28,559 --> 00:15:30,158
A good father, a good mother.

282
00:15:30,159 --> 00:15:32,560
You've raised a fine daughter.

283
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:35,678
This family will do.

284
00:15:35,679 --> 00:15:36,719
You're hired.

285
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,680
Please follow me.

286
00:16:01,279 --> 00:16:02,999
These two adjoining courtyards

287
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,479
both belong to the Lu family.

288
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:06,640
Seventh Master lives in the eastern one.

289
00:16:06,679 --> 00:16:07,878
You'll live in the western one.

290
00:16:07,879 --> 00:16:10,040
You'll be in charge
of the day-to-day business.

291
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:12,040
The accounts
will be settled once a month.

292
00:16:13,159 --> 00:16:16,079
Scholar Han
and his mother live over there.

293
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:19,199
You've already met Scholar Han.

294
00:16:19,200 --> 00:16:20,599
He's learned and courteous.

295
00:16:20,639 --> 00:16:23,040
If there's anything you don't
understand, you can go ask him.

296
00:16:23,679 --> 00:16:24,959
Get settled in first.

297
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:26,158
I have work to do.

298
00:16:26,159 --> 00:16:27,280
Thank you.

299
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,719
Three rooms.

300
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:43,680
That's enough for the three of us.

301
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:49,239
This courtyard may look a little old,

302
00:16:49,679 --> 00:16:51,239
but it's actually well built.

303
00:16:52,159 --> 00:16:52,918
Look.

304
00:16:52,919 --> 00:16:54,558
Even these floor tiles

305
00:16:54,559 --> 00:16:56,479
are made of fine materials.

306
00:16:56,559 --> 00:16:57,758
I'll tidy everything up later.

307
00:16:57,759 --> 00:17:00,440
Once we have it all arranged,
it'll be a nice place to live.

308
00:17:01,519 --> 00:17:02,640
I'll take

309
00:17:02,919 --> 00:17:04,199
this job?

310
00:17:04,519 --> 00:17:06,278
It's just that without a fixed wage,

311
00:17:06,279 --> 00:17:08,159
I can't help feeling a little uneasy.

312
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:10,278
There may be no fixed wage,

313
00:17:10,279 --> 00:17:11,919
but at least
we won't have to spend money

314
00:17:11,920 --> 00:17:13,399
renting a place elsewhere.

315
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:15,078
And all our neighbors

316
00:17:15,079 --> 00:17:16,639
are scholarly families.

317
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:18,838
Nothing was stolen
even with the shop left open.

318
00:17:18,839 --> 00:17:19,800
That shows

319
00:17:19,839 --> 00:17:21,079
it's safe around here.

320
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:24,959
Mister Lu seems quite amiable.

321
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:26,639
And Scholar Han

322
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:28,199
doesn't put on airs at all.

323
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:29,919
He seems easy to get along with.

324
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,358
What did Mister Lu say just now?

325
00:17:33,359 --> 00:17:34,598
I didn't understand him.

326
00:17:34,599 --> 00:17:35,798
He's a fortune-teller.

327
00:17:35,799 --> 00:17:37,240
He can read faces, right?

328
00:17:39,119 --> 00:17:40,439
He said

329
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:43,159
Father and Mother love me dearly

330
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,639
and raised me well.

331
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:46,599
He was saying how capable you both are.

332
00:17:53,160 --> 00:17:55,558
We won't touch
a penny of Lanxiang's money.

333
00:17:55,559 --> 00:17:57,838
Your father and I
have saved a few dozen taels.

334
00:17:57,839 --> 00:17:59,480
If we're careful with our spending,

335
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,800
we'll manage just fine.

336
00:18:01,839 --> 00:18:03,359
Why don't we give it a try?

337
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:06,079
All right, let's give it a try.

338
00:18:07,279 --> 00:18:09,359
We're moving into a new home!

339
00:18:12,759 --> 00:18:14,359
Look at you jumping for joy,

340
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:16,280
just like a little girl.

341
00:18:17,700 --> 00:18:23,340
(Lu Family Painting
and Calligraphy Shop)

342
00:18:24,300 --> 00:18:29,700
♪Through rise and fall, people meet
and part as they always do♪

343
00:18:31,759 --> 00:18:33,518
Put it there and take a break.

344
00:18:33,519 --> 00:18:34,439
I'll do it in a bit.

345
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:35,879
It's fine. Take it easy.

346
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:37,280
Put it in the back room first.

347
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:42,379
♪Plum blossoms bloom,
enduring the frost♪

348
00:18:42,380 --> 00:18:47,939
♪Yet their proud spirit fades
with wind and snow♪

349
00:18:47,940 --> 00:18:51,419
♪Bamboo shadows
embrace quiet contentment♪

350
00:18:51,420 --> 00:18:54,379
♪Only orchids dwell in secluded places♪

351
00:18:54,380 --> 00:19:00,460
♪Watching the old
and new take turns in this world♪

352
00:19:03,279 --> 00:19:04,318
Don't move it. Don't.

353
00:19:04,319 --> 00:19:05,240
I'll do it.

354
00:19:05,319 --> 00:19:06,520
I know.

355
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:10,679
Come on. Let's do it together.

356
00:19:10,839 --> 00:19:12,318
Don't move. All right. That's good.

357
00:19:12,319 --> 00:19:13,480
Move it back a little.

358
00:19:13,759 --> 00:19:14,839
Good. That's fine.

359
00:19:16,500 --> 00:19:25,580
♪I read every joy
and sorrow behind the curtain♪

360
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:39,278
This dish is really well made.

361
00:19:39,279 --> 00:19:40,639
That's everything.

362
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,598
You all go get some rest.

363
00:19:42,599 --> 00:19:43,520
All right.

364
00:19:45,039 --> 00:19:46,159
Granny Du.

365
00:19:46,160 --> 00:19:48,558
You're the eldest here.
Please take the seat of honor.

366
00:19:48,559 --> 00:19:50,558
You're our host today.

367
00:19:50,559 --> 00:19:51,798
You should sit first.

368
00:19:51,799 --> 00:19:52,919
Sit.

369
00:19:53,759 --> 00:19:54,479
Come on.

370
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:55,318
Everyone have a seat.

371
00:19:55,319 --> 00:19:56,320
Have a seat.

372
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,119
Let's all sit down.

373
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:58,919
All right.

374
00:19:59,119 --> 00:19:59,839
Good.

375
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:01,959
Come on.

376
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:02,810
Sit.

377
00:20:02,820 --> 00:20:03,719
Mother, come quickly.

378
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:04,760
Come on.

379
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:10,879
Today we're celebrating Lanxiang and
her family moving into their new home.

380
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:13,159
As the eldest here,
I'll say a few words first.

381
00:20:14,359 --> 00:20:17,159
May your family's life grow more
prosperous with each passing day.

382
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:18,240
May you prosper.

383
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:19,999
May you prosper.

384
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:22,540
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

385
00:20:25,039 --> 00:20:25,679
Let's eat.

386
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,719
Let's eat.

387
00:20:26,720 --> 00:20:27,839
Let's eat.

388
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:29,119
Try this.

389
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:33,538
Lanxiang.

390
00:20:33,539 --> 00:20:34,558
(Du Dasong, Du Xiaolian's older brother)

391
00:20:34,559 --> 00:20:36,800
How does it feel
living in your new home?

392
00:20:39,559 --> 00:20:41,358
My mother couldn't bear
to leave Granny Du,

393
00:20:41,359 --> 00:20:43,560
Aunt Chen, or Aunt Liu.

394
00:20:44,599 --> 00:20:46,639
Wenchang Street
isn't far from here either.

395
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:49,100
When we go grocery shopping,
we can stop by while we're out.

396
00:20:49,112 --> 00:20:51,879
Don't get tired of me
coming over for tea all the time.

397
00:20:51,880 --> 00:20:53,800
Of course not.

398
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,910
Whenever you feel
like going back for a visit,

399
00:20:55,920 --> 00:20:57,359
just go.

400
00:20:57,496 --> 00:20:58,910
And if you ever run into trouble,

401
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:01,280
don't treat us like outsiders.

402
00:21:02,079 --> 00:21:03,719
We may not be capable of much,

403
00:21:03,720 --> 00:21:05,679
but if you need help carrying things

404
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:06,960
or a few people to back you up,

405
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:09,399
we can certainly lend a hand.

406
00:21:09,680 --> 00:21:10,960
My mother is right.

407
00:21:11,310 --> 00:21:13,000
My sister Xiaolian is rather naive.

408
00:21:13,064 --> 00:21:14,630
Thanks to Lanxiang looking out for her,

409
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:16,390
she's been able
to get by without trouble.

410
00:21:16,408 --> 00:21:17,720
Whatever happens in the future,

411
00:21:18,039 --> 00:21:18,758
Uncle Xu,

412
00:21:18,759 --> 00:21:19,639
just call on me.

413
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:21,999
Dasong is right.

414
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:22,999
Just call on us.

415
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:23,800
All right.

416
00:21:24,400 --> 00:21:25,318
Let's have a toast.

417
00:21:25,319 --> 00:21:26,959
Come on.

418
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:27,679
Let's drink.

419
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:28,758
Let's drink.

420
00:21:28,759 --> 00:21:29,679
Come on.

421
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:30,479
Eat up.

422
00:21:30,480 --> 00:21:31,159
Good.

423
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:32,399
Help yourselves.

424
00:21:32,440 --> 00:21:33,598
Don't be shy.

425
00:21:33,600 --> 00:21:35,528
Since you're here,
make yourselves at home.

426
00:21:36,079 --> 00:21:37,760
Try my cooking.

427
00:21:39,040 --> 00:21:40,110
Have some more to drink.

428
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:41,520
Eat some more.

429
00:21:44,519 --> 00:21:45,598
Watch your step.

430
00:21:45,599 --> 00:21:46,879
I am.

431
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:48,598
I'm not even drunk.

432
00:21:48,599 --> 00:21:50,399
I'm just so happy today.

433
00:21:50,400 --> 00:21:51,278
All right.

434
00:21:51,279 --> 00:21:53,358
Let me enjoy myself.

435
00:21:53,359 --> 00:21:55,639
I'm really not drunk.

436
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:56,639
Lie down.

437
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,839
Over there.

438
00:21:58,119 --> 00:21:59,079
Lie down.

439
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:01,800
All right. Go to sleep.

440
00:22:03,680 --> 00:22:05,520
Look at him.

441
00:22:05,799 --> 00:22:06,919
He's that happy.

442
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:35,960
I truly never dreamed

443
00:22:37,920 --> 00:22:39,159
that in this lifetime,

444
00:22:39,839 --> 00:22:41,399
I'd get to live in such a nice house.

445
00:22:41,400 --> 00:22:43,879
Look how easily pleased your mother is.

446
00:22:44,160 --> 00:22:47,200
I'll get you
an even better house someday.

447
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:53,040
Your father is right.

448
00:22:54,079 --> 00:22:55,879
Once we've saved enough money,

449
00:22:55,880 --> 00:22:57,159
we'll buy a home of our own

450
00:22:57,160 --> 00:22:58,599
and our own land.

451
00:22:59,319 --> 00:23:00,399
Really?

452
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:02,479
Of course it's true.

453
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:04,479
Why are you getting up again?

454
00:23:04,480 --> 00:23:05,879
Where are you going?

455
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:08,599
What are you looking for?

456
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:11,479
Hold on to it.

457
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:13,239
Look carefully.

458
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:13,790
Give it to me.

459
00:23:13,800 --> 00:23:17,000
We're registered free commoners now.

460
00:23:17,079 --> 00:23:19,838
- All right.
- We can buy whatever we want.

461
00:23:19,839 --> 00:23:20,318
All right.

462
00:23:20,319 --> 00:23:21,639
- Right.
- Isn't it?

463
00:23:23,680 --> 00:23:24,919
Free commoners.

464
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:26,118
This free commoner should sleep.

465
00:23:26,119 --> 00:23:26,719
All right.

466
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:28,040
I am going to sleep.

467
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:39,040
Tell me.

468
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:46,040
Tell me

469
00:23:47,079 --> 00:23:49,599
what all this says.

470
00:23:56,839 --> 00:23:58,758
This is the head of the household.

471
00:23:58,759 --> 00:24:00,520
Father's name.

472
00:24:01,319 --> 00:24:03,358
(Xu Wanquan)
Xu Wanquan.

473
00:24:03,359 --> 00:24:04,480
Right.

474
00:24:04,559 --> 00:24:05,838
Registered as free commoners.

475
00:24:05,839 --> 00:24:07,879
Three people in the household.

476
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,639
One male.

477
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:11,119
An adult.

478
00:24:11,279 --> 00:24:13,479
Two females.

479
00:24:13,480 --> 00:24:16,879
That's Mother and me.

480
00:24:20,680 --> 00:24:22,118
Then what do

481
00:24:22,119 --> 00:24:23,480
these three characters say?

482
00:24:24,480 --> 00:24:26,359
No property.

483
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:29,758
It means we don't own a house yet

484
00:24:29,759 --> 00:24:31,358
or any land.

485
00:24:31,359 --> 00:24:32,960
So if we

486
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,719
really save enough money someday,

487
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:36,119
can we buy our own house

488
00:24:36,160 --> 00:24:37,320
and land?

489
00:24:37,640 --> 00:24:38,480
Yes.

490
00:24:43,880 --> 00:24:44,919
What about an ox?

491
00:24:45,480 --> 00:24:47,000
Can we buy an ox?

492
00:24:47,400 --> 00:24:48,399
Yes.

493
00:24:49,359 --> 00:24:50,480
We can.

494
00:25:01,319 --> 00:25:02,560
That's wonderful.

495
00:25:31,839 --> 00:25:33,679
Thank you
for your blessings, Bodhisattva.

496
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:36,639
Please keep
my whole family safe and well.

497
00:25:38,720 --> 00:25:39,959
Bodhisattva, please bless us.

498
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:41,439
Please bless our Lanxiang

499
00:25:41,440 --> 00:25:43,839
with a good husband someday,

500
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:47,520
one who is educated and literate

501
00:25:47,839 --> 00:25:49,320
and cherishes her.

502
00:25:50,359 --> 00:25:51,760
Bodhisattva, please bless him

503
00:25:52,039 --> 00:25:53,558
with good looks

504
00:25:53,559 --> 00:25:55,079
and good health.

505
00:25:55,319 --> 00:25:57,200
Thank you
for your blessings, Bodhisattva.

506
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:00,639
Thank you
for your blessings, Bodhisattva.

507
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:04,599
(Now that my parents are healthy)

508
00:26:05,039 --> 00:26:06,480
(and our family is together,)

509
00:26:07,599 --> 00:26:09,520
(I ask for nothing more.)

510
00:26:11,720 --> 00:26:13,520
(We'll live our lives well)

511
00:26:14,359 --> 00:26:16,439
(and be worthy
of the Bodhisattva's blessings.)

512
00:26:26,280 --> 00:26:27,960
Once we traced it
to Liang Yu and Dai Rong,

513
00:26:27,976 --> 00:26:29,848
it became difficult
to investigate any further.

514
00:26:29,920 --> 00:26:31,520
Those two insist

515
00:26:31,816 --> 00:26:33,310
that they colluded with the Wo pirates

516
00:26:33,319 --> 00:26:34,639
for personal gain.

517
00:26:35,112 --> 00:26:36,910
Duke Xianguo
was ready to close the case,

518
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,456
but the Crown Prince suddenly ordered

519
00:26:38,472 --> 00:26:39,630
the interrogation to continue.

520
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:41,520
I was actually relieved

521
00:26:41,599 --> 00:26:42,999
to have the Crown Prince's order,

522
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:45,520
thinking I could uncover
whoever was behind them.

523
00:26:46,680 --> 00:26:47,480
But...

524
00:26:48,799 --> 00:26:51,038
The prison at our Rear Military Command

525
00:26:51,039 --> 00:26:53,079
really does have ears everywhere.

526
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:54,888
There's no way
to guard against them all.

527
00:26:55,896 --> 00:26:58,552
Dai Rong and Liang Yu
signed confessions in blood.

528
00:26:58,696 --> 00:27:01,710
His Majesty reprimanded Dai Qing for
failing to keep his household in order,

529
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:04,152
demoted him by two ranks
and withheld his salary for a year.

530
00:27:04,200 --> 00:27:06,888
This case can only be closed
with Liang Yu and Dai Rong

531
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:09,830
convicted of taking bribes, leaving
the country without authorization,

532
00:27:09,880 --> 00:27:11,879
and illegally going to sea.

533
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:16,719
Liang Yu was a Third-Rank Commander,

534
00:27:16,720 --> 00:27:18,399
and Dai Rong a Sixth-Rank Registrar.

535
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:20,399
How could they have gotten
through many checkpoints

536
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:22,399
and made so many people
risk their lives for them?

537
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:27,879
His Majesty is in poor health,

538
00:27:28,319 --> 00:27:30,038
and undercurrents are stirring at court.

539
00:27:30,039 --> 00:27:32,038
His Majesty doesn't
want to make matters worse,

540
00:27:32,040 --> 00:27:34,392
so he can only let the case end
without getting to the truth.

541
00:27:38,680 --> 00:27:40,630
No wonder Crown Prince
decided to come to Jinling

542
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:42,650
to offer sacrifices
to Heaven and pray for blessings.

543
00:27:46,319 --> 00:27:47,439
Back then,

544
00:27:48,559 --> 00:27:50,000
too much blood was shed,

545
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:52,839
and too many died unjustly.

546
00:28:06,039 --> 00:28:07,358
Whether thunder or gentle rain,

547
00:28:07,359 --> 00:28:09,040
all are the sovereign's grace.

548
00:28:21,839 --> 00:28:23,359
Young Master is in a bad mood.

549
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:24,399
Is it because

550
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:26,679
I didn't handle
Lanxiang's matter properly?

551
00:28:30,160 --> 00:28:31,399
You're overthinking it.

552
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:34,439
Seeing Young Master like this,

553
00:28:34,440 --> 00:28:35,919
how could I not overthink it?

554
00:28:48,824 --> 00:28:50,696
(Lu Family Painting and Calligraphy Shop)
This is the painting

555
00:28:50,700 --> 00:28:52,632
and calligraphy shop
where Uncle Xu works now.

556
00:28:52,664 --> 00:28:53,790
His family lives

557
00:28:53,799 --> 00:28:55,399
in the small courtyard behind the shop.

558
00:29:03,128 --> 00:29:04,760
These flowers are beautifully arranged.

559
00:29:05,039 --> 00:29:07,159
It's as if whoever did this
had been formally trained.

560
00:29:21,000 --> 00:29:21,639
Look.

561
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:23,240
This sachet is so distinctive.

562
00:29:24,888 --> 00:29:26,360
It even has laurels embroidered on it.

563
00:29:26,550 --> 00:29:27,590
Sorry to keep you waiting.

564
00:29:27,599 --> 00:29:29,079
An auspicious sign.

565
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:36,359
Sir, you...

566
00:29:44,599 --> 00:29:45,520
Young Master.

567
00:29:48,030 --> 00:29:49,608
- It seems...
- Shopkeeper.

568
00:29:49,688 --> 00:29:51,390
How much are these
two sachets with laurels?

569
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:52,870
Could you work out the price for me?

570
00:29:54,120 --> 00:29:56,150
I'm just looking around.
Go ahead with your work.

571
00:29:56,160 --> 00:29:56,558
Then...

572
00:29:56,559 --> 00:29:57,959
I'll be right back.

573
00:29:57,960 --> 00:29:59,359
Feel free to look around.

574
00:30:00,039 --> 00:30:01,159
Here.

575
00:30:06,720 --> 00:30:07,999
Would you like both of these?

576
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:08,919
Both.

577
00:30:09,079 --> 00:30:11,038
2.1 coins each.

578
00:30:11,039 --> 00:30:13,118
That's 4.2 coins altogether.

579
00:30:13,119 --> 00:30:13,679
Certainly.

580
00:30:13,680 --> 00:30:29,420
♪Who dares say wealth and honor
will last a hundred years?♪

581
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:31,879
Lanxiang has really
been hiding her talents.

582
00:30:32,079 --> 00:30:34,038
She plays the sanxian well
and sings even better.

583
00:30:34,039 --> 00:30:40,940
♪Who dares say how many generations
will live in poverty?♪

584
00:30:41,420 --> 00:30:47,859
♪Who dares say who will die first♪

585
00:30:47,860 --> 00:30:51,259
♪Or live to a hundred?♪

586
00:30:51,260 --> 00:30:54,920
♪Who dares say a couple
will grow old together♪

587
00:30:54,930 --> 00:30:58,270
♪With their children seeing them off?♪

588
00:30:58,279 --> 00:30:59,999
Uncle Xu's current employer

589
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:01,599
is Lu Xie,

590
00:31:01,920 --> 00:31:03,760
courtesy name Hezhi, art name Zongbai.

591
00:31:05,160 --> 00:31:06,480
He was named Third Place Scholar

592
00:31:06,559 --> 00:31:07,599
by the deposed emperor.

593
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:09,798
His temperament
became eccentric and unconventional.

594
00:31:09,800 --> 00:31:12,680
He refuses to marry or take office,
preferring the company of performers

595
00:31:12,728 --> 00:31:14,200
and composing melodies and lyrics.

596
00:31:15,599 --> 00:31:18,159
Lanxiang is probably
helping Mister Zongbai

597
00:31:18,160 --> 00:31:19,560
transcribe songs and lyrics.

598
00:31:22,200 --> 00:31:23,000
That person?

599
00:31:30,839 --> 00:31:31,879
I don't know.

600
00:31:32,792 --> 00:31:33,990
I'll look into it right away.

601
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:40,099
♪Who dares say?♪

602
00:31:40,100 --> 00:31:48,219
♪No one dares say♪

603
00:31:48,220 --> 00:31:58,700
♪No one dares say♪

604
00:32:03,460 --> 00:32:07,100
(No One Dares Say)

605
00:32:11,680 --> 00:32:12,480
Come.

606
00:32:24,880 --> 00:32:27,399
Young Master...

607
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:35,318
No wonder the magpies
have been chirping all day.

608
00:32:35,320 --> 00:32:36,696
Please have a seat, Young Master.

609
00:32:37,039 --> 00:32:37,879
No need.

610
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:41,078
Mother, boil some water.

611
00:32:41,079 --> 00:32:42,520
Make Young Master a pot of tea.

612
00:32:46,839 --> 00:32:47,839
Young Master.

613
00:32:47,880 --> 00:32:49,278
This is Scholar Han.

614
00:32:49,279 --> 00:32:50,679
He lives next door to us.

615
00:32:51,279 --> 00:32:53,199
And this is our former master,

616
00:32:53,200 --> 00:32:54,600
Young Master of the Lin Residence.

617
00:32:56,600 --> 00:32:58,030
Please sit for a while, Young Master.

618
00:32:58,039 --> 00:32:59,200
I'll make some tea.

619
00:33:15,759 --> 00:33:18,000
No wonder you have
such a distinguished bearing.

620
00:33:18,319 --> 00:33:20,200
So you're Assistant Commander Lin,

621
00:33:20,248 --> 00:33:21,800
accomplished in both letters and arms.

622
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:25,639
Next year is
the triennial provincial examination.

623
00:33:25,839 --> 00:33:28,280
Aren't you preparing
for the provincial examination?

624
00:33:28,880 --> 00:33:30,239
Mister Lu has trouble with his hand

625
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,560
and finds it difficult to write.

626
00:33:31,599 --> 00:33:33,919
so he hired me
to transcribe lyrics and songs.

627
00:33:34,400 --> 00:33:37,720
That way, I can earn some money
to help support my family.

628
00:33:38,039 --> 00:33:40,199
Now I need to prepare
for the provincial examination,

629
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:42,376
but I've been worried
I couldn't manage everything.

630
00:33:43,519 --> 00:33:45,639
Fortunately, Lanxiang is here.

631
00:33:46,039 --> 00:33:47,239
Once I hand everything

632
00:33:47,240 --> 00:33:48,520
over to Lanxiang,

633
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:51,119
I can focus on preparing
for the examination.

634
00:33:53,400 --> 00:33:54,359
Lanxiang.

635
00:33:54,720 --> 00:33:55,919
No need to fuss.

636
00:33:56,120 --> 00:33:57,710
I just came to see how you're doing.

637
00:33:57,720 --> 00:33:59,352
I'll sit for a while and then leave.

638
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:01,599
Go ahead.

639
00:34:11,559 --> 00:34:12,558
The tea isn't very good.

640
00:34:12,559 --> 00:34:14,640
Please have some anyway, Young Master.

641
00:34:16,719 --> 00:34:18,640
You've been to military camps before.

642
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:21,720
A soldier isn't so delicate.

643
00:34:22,679 --> 00:34:24,839
One who can endure hardship
and enjoy good fortune

644
00:34:24,840 --> 00:34:26,200
is a true hero.

645
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:34,518
Don't stand.

646
00:34:34,519 --> 00:34:35,640
Sit down and let's talk.

647
00:34:45,752 --> 00:34:47,910
How is business at
the painting and calligraphy shop?

648
00:34:49,360 --> 00:34:50,600
Not very good.

649
00:34:50,760 --> 00:34:51,439
However,

650
00:34:51,440 --> 00:34:53,799
the brush cases, sachets,
and other things my mother makes

651
00:34:53,800 --> 00:34:55,519
have been quite popular.

652
00:34:57,320 --> 00:34:59,319
And thanks to Scholar Han,

653
00:34:59,320 --> 00:35:01,839
I was recommended to Mister Lu
to transcribe songs and lyrics

654
00:35:01,840 --> 00:35:03,399
and can earn some wages.

655
00:35:03,400 --> 00:35:05,038
With all that added together,

656
00:35:05,039 --> 00:35:06,320
we're getting by.

657
00:35:06,840 --> 00:35:08,080
I can't take the credit.

658
00:35:08,239 --> 00:35:11,839
It's because Lanxiang is literate
and well-versed in music

659
00:35:11,840 --> 00:35:14,320
that Mister Lu took notice of her.

660
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:19,760
You're well-versed in music?

661
00:35:20,480 --> 00:35:22,320
Scholar Han gives me too much credit.

662
00:35:22,360 --> 00:35:24,238
I'm learning as I go

663
00:35:24,239 --> 00:35:25,959
and doing the best I can.

664
00:35:26,199 --> 00:35:28,238
Lanxiang is exceptionally
quick to learn.

665
00:35:28,240 --> 00:35:29,820
She understands as soon as she's shown.

666
00:35:30,000 --> 00:35:32,080
That's because Scholar Han
is a good teacher.

667
00:35:51,119 --> 00:35:52,238
My writing isn't good yet.

668
00:35:52,239 --> 00:35:53,439
Once I've improved,

669
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:54,800
I'll show it to you, Young Master.

670
00:35:58,840 --> 00:35:59,760
All right.

671
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:01,519
I'll look at it

672
00:36:01,599 --> 00:36:02,720
once you've improved.

673
00:36:04,600 --> 00:36:06,590
I still have some matters
to attend to at home,

674
00:36:06,599 --> 00:36:07,919
so I'll take my leave.

675
00:36:07,920 --> 00:36:10,240
I'll let you catch up.

676
00:36:13,320 --> 00:36:13,839
Mother.

677
00:36:13,840 --> 00:36:15,320
See Scholar Han out.

678
00:36:18,719 --> 00:36:19,319
Oh, right.

679
00:36:19,320 --> 00:36:21,518
Madam Han wanted
your embroidery patterns.

680
00:36:21,519 --> 00:36:23,078
I'll take them over while I'm there.

681
00:36:23,079 --> 00:36:23,879
All right.

682
00:36:25,840 --> 00:36:26,720
Let's go.

683
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:27,718
Young Master.

684
00:36:27,720 --> 00:36:29,016
Please make yourself comfortable.

685
00:36:32,840 --> 00:36:33,959
How about this one?

686
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:36,359
This one.

687
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:37,359
Careful.

688
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:41,720
They're all good.

689
00:36:46,599 --> 00:36:47,399
Young Master.

690
00:36:47,400 --> 00:36:48,359
Have some tea.

691
00:36:49,159 --> 00:36:49,999
All right.

692
00:36:53,400 --> 00:36:54,640
It seems

693
00:36:55,679 --> 00:36:57,120
you're doing quite well.

694
00:36:58,400 --> 00:36:59,279
We've been fortunate

695
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:01,479
to find a good employer
and good neighbors.

696
00:37:03,480 --> 00:37:05,279
I was thinking that after we settled in,

697
00:37:05,280 --> 00:37:07,399
Mother and I could make
some fashionable trinkets

698
00:37:07,400 --> 00:37:08,792
and send them to the Lin Residence

699
00:37:08,824 --> 00:37:10,680
for First Madam
and the young ladies to enjoy.

700
00:37:10,719 --> 00:37:13,760
I didn't expect you
to come see us first.

701
00:37:16,119 --> 00:37:17,519
Since you left,

702
00:37:19,280 --> 00:37:20,600
Yuchan and the others

703
00:37:21,320 --> 00:37:22,760
have been thinking about you.

704
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:25,039
Have you ever missed

705
00:37:25,416 --> 00:37:26,792
your days at the Lin Residence?

706
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:29,279
Of course I miss

707
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:30,839
Yuchan and the others.

708
00:37:30,840 --> 00:37:32,118
As long as our bond remains,

709
00:37:32,119 --> 00:37:33,638
distance cannot keep us apart.

710
00:37:33,639 --> 00:37:36,200
Besides, we're only a few streets away.

711
00:37:39,000 --> 00:37:40,479
From the looks of it,

712
00:37:40,679 --> 00:37:42,600
you're having the time of your life.

713
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:44,720
I doubt you've given them a thought.

714
00:37:45,360 --> 00:37:46,479
All right.

715
00:37:46,880 --> 00:37:48,879
I don't want to hear
any more of your sweet talk.

716
00:37:48,880 --> 00:37:49,919
I'm leaving.

717
00:37:51,119 --> 00:37:52,078
Young Master.

718
00:37:52,079 --> 00:37:53,879
I really wasn't lying.

719
00:37:54,159 --> 00:37:56,479
I just feel
we have plenty of time ahead,

720
00:37:56,480 --> 00:37:58,598
and we're all still in Jinling City.

721
00:37:58,599 --> 00:37:59,638
As long as we care,

722
00:37:59,639 --> 00:38:01,200
our bond will never be broken.

723
00:38:05,840 --> 00:38:08,760
Now that's something I like to hear.

724
00:38:09,599 --> 00:38:10,999
As long as we care,

725
00:38:13,159 --> 00:38:14,399
our bond will never be broken.

726
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:29,120
You

727
00:38:29,840 --> 00:38:32,120
really are like wild grass.

728
00:38:32,840 --> 00:38:35,200
You thrive wherever you are.

729
00:38:38,599 --> 00:38:40,680
It's just these butterflies
that are annoying,

730
00:38:41,559 --> 00:38:43,120
fluttering around

731
00:38:47,320 --> 00:38:48,519
and getting in the way.

732
00:38:49,360 --> 00:38:50,680
They're such a nuisance.

733
00:38:54,400 --> 00:38:55,279
Young Master.

734
00:38:55,280 --> 00:38:56,359
Where are the butterflies?

735
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:57,760
I'll chase them out.

736
00:39:00,800 --> 00:39:01,759
Jiugao.

737
00:39:01,760 --> 00:39:03,039
Did you find out everything?

738
00:39:03,199 --> 00:39:04,038
Yes, Young Master.

739
00:39:04,039 --> 00:39:05,039
I did.

740
00:39:06,119 --> 00:39:07,518
Next door to Uncle Xu

741
00:39:07,519 --> 00:39:09,038
live Scholar Han and his mother.

742
00:39:09,040 --> 00:39:11,096
Scholar Han's name is Liang,
courtesy name Yizhen.

743
00:39:11,128 --> 00:39:12,870
After passing the county-level
examination four years ago,

744
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:14,879
he moved from Suzhou
to Jinling and settled here.

745
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:16,118
His father died when he was young.

746
00:39:16,120 --> 00:39:18,536
He also has an older sister
who married and lives in Suzhou.

747
00:39:18,616 --> 00:39:21,110
But her husband
died of illness six months ago.

748
00:39:21,119 --> 00:39:22,038
They had no children,

749
00:39:22,039 --> 00:39:23,279
and she's fallen on hard times.

750
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:24,959
Han Liang has already hired a boat

751
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:26,959
and plans to bring
his widowed sister back home.

752
00:39:35,360 --> 00:39:37,519
So he's not just
all looks and no substance.

753
00:39:47,039 --> 00:39:48,038
Young Master.

754
00:39:48,039 --> 00:39:49,999
Perhaps the butterfly landed somewhere.

755
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,359
I don't hear anything.

756
00:39:56,239 --> 00:39:57,359
Shut up.

757
00:39:58,480 --> 00:39:59,118
But...

758
00:39:59,119 --> 00:39:59,839
Young Master.

759
00:39:59,840 --> 00:40:00,792
I really didn't see one.

760
00:40:00,840 --> 00:40:02,350
Go.

761
00:40:37,420 --> 00:40:43,620
(Plan before taking action,
know when to stop and you will gain.)

762
00:40:45,060 --> 00:40:50,620
(Six Months Later)

763
00:40:54,940 --> 00:40:57,638
(Jinling Imperial Palace)

764
00:40:57,639 --> 00:41:00,479
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor hereby decrees.

765
00:41:00,630 --> 00:41:02,490
(Crown Prince)
Lin Jinqi, Assistant Commander

766
00:41:02,504 --> 00:41:03,430
of the Shence Garrison,

767
00:41:03,440 --> 00:41:04,598
you have
distinguished yourself in battle

768
00:41:04,600 --> 00:41:06,520
and rendered meritorious service
in your duties.

769
00:41:06,568 --> 00:41:09,910
As you are upright in conduct,
diligent in duty, and keen in judgment,

770
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:12,760
you are hereby appointed
Commander of the Shence Garrison

771
00:41:12,856 --> 00:41:14,184
and granted this imperial decree.

772
00:41:14,230 --> 00:41:15,768
May you uphold loyalty in your conduct,

773
00:41:15,816 --> 00:41:17,110
govern your men with benevolence,

774
00:41:17,119 --> 00:41:18,279
and use wisdom
to discern the slightest signs,

775
00:41:18,280 --> 00:41:19,518
guarding against treachery
and defending against enemies.

776
00:41:19,519 --> 00:41:20,919
Devote yourself to your duties

777
00:41:20,920 --> 00:41:22,936
and repay the imperial
favor bestowed upon you.

778
00:41:22,984 --> 00:41:24,320
Obey this decree with reverence.

779
00:41:25,159 --> 00:41:28,919
I shall faithfully fulfill my duties
and never fail His Majesty's grace.

780
00:41:37,016 --> 00:41:38,430
I came to Jinling by imperial decree

781
00:41:38,440 --> 00:41:40,700
first to pay respects
at the Sacred Ancestor's mausoleum,

782
00:41:40,720 --> 00:41:42,430
and second, on behalf
of my imperial father,

783
00:41:42,440 --> 00:41:44,860
to commend all of you who have
rendered distinguished service.

784
00:41:44,872 --> 00:41:45,750
You may all rise.

785
00:41:45,760 --> 00:41:48,328
- Long live the Crown Prince.
- Long live the Crown Prince.

786
00:41:53,208 --> 00:41:54,190
(Xu Guangyi, Duke Xiangguo)

787
00:41:54,199 --> 00:41:56,359
(Jinling Defense Commander)
Commander Lin has achieved much at such a young age.

788
00:41:56,360 --> 00:41:57,550
(Commander of)
This promotion

789
00:41:57,560 --> 00:41:59,910
(the Central Military Command)
truly has everyone's support.

790
00:41:59,920 --> 00:42:00,759
Indeed.

791
00:42:00,760 --> 00:42:01,479
That's right.

792
00:42:01,480 --> 00:42:02,839
Commander Xu, you flatter me.

793
00:42:02,880 --> 00:42:04,359
I am hardly worthy of such praise.

794
00:42:05,519 --> 00:42:06,638
Chengze.

795
00:42:06,639 --> 00:42:07,598
I hear

796
00:42:07,599 --> 00:42:09,519
you're going to marry
Fengtai's younger sister.

797
00:42:10,280 --> 00:42:12,319
Your Highness.
The wedding date has been set

798
00:42:12,320 --> 00:42:13,880
for the sixth day of the sixth month.

799
00:42:15,480 --> 00:42:16,439
I humbly dare

800
00:42:16,440 --> 00:42:18,904
to invite Your Highness
to join us for a celebratory drink.

801
00:42:20,159 --> 00:42:22,320
I wouldn't miss that wedding feast.

802
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:23,999
Come to think of it,

803
00:42:24,000 --> 00:42:26,320
Jiarong calls me Uncle,

804
00:42:26,599 --> 00:42:29,080
and after the marriage,
she'll call Fengtai Uncle as well.

805
00:42:29,360 --> 00:42:30,678
By that reckoning,

806
00:42:30,679 --> 00:42:32,439
Fengtai and I

807
00:42:32,559 --> 00:42:34,160
will be family, too.

808
00:42:38,079 --> 00:42:39,359
I am deeply honored.

809
00:42:39,719 --> 00:42:40,680
Honored indeed.

810
00:42:40,880 --> 00:42:41,999
Indeed.

811
00:42:42,159 --> 00:42:44,919
I hear Commander Lin
has yet to take a wife.

812
00:42:44,920 --> 00:42:47,519
Have you arranged a marriage yet?

813
00:42:48,159 --> 00:42:50,158
A man like Fengtai

814
00:42:50,159 --> 00:42:52,320
surely wouldn't remain unattached.

815
00:42:53,519 --> 00:42:54,879
It's a long story.

816
00:42:55,320 --> 00:42:57,640
A good match has always
been ordained by Heaven.

817
00:42:57,719 --> 00:43:00,240
Perhaps the right time
simply hasn't come.

818
00:43:05,060 --> 00:43:07,660
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

819
00:43:09,432 --> 00:43:11,910
Didn't you say it blooms
at night and smells wonderful?

820
00:43:12,360 --> 00:43:13,640
I happened to divide the plant,

821
00:43:14,239 --> 00:43:15,519
so I brought you

822
00:43:15,599 --> 00:43:16,479
one of the new shoots.

